title: "Scholarmap: mapping a researcher's scientific and industrial network from public sources"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hassan
    given-names: Julien
repository-code: "https://github.com/Hsn9403/scholarmap"
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-13"
keywords:
  - research network
  - co-authorship network
  - scientific due diligence
  - KOL mapping
  - OpenAlex
  - patents
  - clinical trials
  - network visualization
abstract: >-
  Scholarmap builds an interactive, filterable map of a researcher's co-authors,
  co-inventors, institutions and industry ties from public sources (OpenAlex,
  Google Scholar, Google Patents, ClinicalTrials.gov, CMS Open Payments,
  Transparence Santé), with cross-source author disambiguation.
